M03 soft-lock: primary objective 1007 ("acquire the security card") can stay
pending forever. Zone 2013086/2013087 (M03_Conversation_Zone 4, entered
without key 1) starts the key conversation M03CON004, and only its end
callback sends 307,3, which adds 1007. The keycard (M03_Key_Card, dropped by
officer 1144682) sends 307,1 on pickup. If the card is picked up while
M03CON004 is still playing (officer already dead near the basement door),
307,1 arrives first, Set_Objective_Status(1007) finds no objective and does
nothing, and the later add leaves 1007 pending.

Remember the pickup in a saved flag (new id 9) and credit it once when 1007
is added. In the normal order (add, then pickup) the flag is never consulted.
Saves without id 9 load with the flag clear, which is the original behaviour.

